# The provider keys op run puts into the router's environment (Suite D7).
# One line per registry provider that has a key; the variable is the one the
# provider's {env:VAR} names, or BUD_<PROVIDER>_API_KEY for an op:// key.
# Each value is an op:// reference, never the key; the real file, with the
# Bud vault's paths, lives in the overlay.
# OPENCODE_GO_API_KEY=op://vault/item/field
# BUD_PROVIDER_API_KEY=op://vault/item/field
